        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3Unused" value="&lt;b&gt;CÓ TRONG REPO NHƯNG KHÔNG CÓ ĐƯỜNG GỌI RUNTIME — không vẽ vào sơ đồ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;AWS S3&lt;/b&gt;: S3Configuration tạo bean AmazonS3 và AWSS3ServiceImpl tồn tại, nhưng không lớp nào inject AWSS3Service. Trang 1 đang ghi &quot;Cloudinary / AWS S3&quot; — theo mã nguồn chỉ Cloudinary được dùng.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;spring-boot-starter-mail&lt;/b&gt;: không có JavaMailSender; email đi qua Microsoft Graph REST.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;spring-boot-starter-thymeleaf&lt;/b&gt;: HomeController trả view &quot;index&quot; nhưng không có thư mục templates/.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;GeoNames&lt;/b&gt; (googleMapService.getLocationInformation): nơi gọi duy nhất đã bị comment.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;redux, redux-saga, @stomp/stompjs&lt;/b&gt;: khai báo trong package.json, không được import ở runtime.&lt;br&gt;• Không có message queue, cache (Redis, @Cacheable) hay STOMP relay ngoài." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="500" y="940" width="780" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3Sec" value="&lt;b&gt;QUAN SÁT BẢO MẬT KHI ĐỐI CHIẾU (chưa sửa code)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Rule /api/v1/conversation/{id}/messages (số nhiều) không khớp endpoint /conversation/{id}/message → mọi user đã đăng nhập đọc được lịch sử chat.&lt;br&gt;• Rule DELETE /api/v1/post/{id} không khớp endpoint thật DELETE /api/v1/post/comment/{id}.&lt;br&gt;• /api/v1/statistic/** chỉ cần đăng nhập, không cần ADMIN.&lt;br&gt;• STOMP SUBSCRIBE không kiểm quyền (WebSocketSecurityConfiguration: anyMessage().permitAll()).&lt;br&gt;• /actuator/** permitAll ở Spring; an toàn chỉ vì nginx không proxy đường này." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#FFF4F4;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1320" y="940" width="620" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3Legend" value="&lt;b&gt;CHÚ GIẢI&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Đường liền xám đậm: gọi đồng bộ (HTTP, gọi hàm trong tiến trình).&lt;br&gt;Đường nét đứt cam: bất đồng bộ — WebSocket/STOMP đẩy về client, ApplicationEvent @Async.&lt;br&gt;Đường xanh lá đậm: truy cập lưu trữ qua JDBC.&lt;br&gt;Khung nét đứt xám: cấu hình có trong repo nhưng không nằm trên đường request của Docker.&lt;br&gt;Mọi khối trên trang này là &lt;b&gt;VERIFIED&lt;/b&gt; từ mã nguồn; không có quan hệ INFERRED.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Nguồn: branch feature/ai-assisted-dev-setup @ ca46696 (working tree), 2026-10-10. Đã đọc: frontend/src/{routes,api,hooks,components}, frontend/nginx.conf.template, frontend/vercel.json, src/main/java/com/vivacon/{controller,security,configuration,service,event,dao,repository}, pom.xml, application-*.yml.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1980" y="940" width="580" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="sa-runtime" name="4. Hạ tầng runtime — mức chứng cứ">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2300" dy="920" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2300" pageHeight="920" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="s4Title" value="VIVACON — HẠ TẦNG RUNTIME, PHÂN BIỆT &quot;CÓ TRONG CẤU HÌNH&quot; VÀ &quot;CHỈ CÓ TRONG TÀI LIỆU&quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Không ghi hostname, IP hay thông tin đăng nhập. Nguồn cấu hình: docker-compose.yml, docker-compose.override.yml, docker-compose.tunnel.yml, Dockerfile, frontend/Dockerfile, frontend/vercel.json&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2220" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4Browser" value="&lt;b&gt;Trình duyệt&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;bundle React chỉ gọi đường dẫn tương đối /api, /ws khi build bằng frontend/Dockerfile (REACT_APP_API_URL=/api)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="200" width="260" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4gEdge" value="BIÊN CÔNG KHAI (tuỳ chọn)" style="swimlane;startSize=30;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;collapsible=0;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="360" y="120" width="360" height="480" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4Cf" value="&lt;b&gt;Cloudflare edge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;TLS + hostname công khai; chỉ có khi chạy docker-compose.tunnel.yml (quick tunnel *.trycloudflare.com)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="s4gEdge">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="80" width="300" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4Vercel" value="&lt;b&gt;Vercel static hosting&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;frontend/vercel.json: CI=false npm run build, rewrite → index.html, không rewrite /api. Trạng thái &quot;đang live&quot; chỉ có trong deployment.md&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="s4gEdge">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="300" width="300" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4gHost" value="DOCKER HOST — compose project &quot;vivacon&quot; (docker-compose.yml)" style="swimlane;startSize=30;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;collapsible=0;fillColor=#F3E5F5;strokeColor=#9673A6;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="780" y="120" width="1060" height="480" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4Cfd" value="&lt;b&gt;cloudflared&lt;/b&gt; — docker-compose.tunnel.yml&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;opt-in, phải chỉ định -f · tunnel --url http://frontend:80 · mem_limit 128m&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="s4gHost">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="80" width="280" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4Fe" value="&lt;b&gt;frontend&lt;/b&gt; — nginx 1.27&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;frontend/Dockerfile · cổng DUY NHẤT được publish: FRONTEND_PORT → 80 · mem_limit 128m&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="s4gHost">
          <mxGeometry x="380" y="80" width="280" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4Be" value="&lt;b&gt;backend&lt;/b&gt; — Spring Boot, profile prod&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;Dockerfile (temurin 11 JRE) · :8080 nội bộ · healthcheck /actuator/health · mem_limit 1200m&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fillColor=#B1DDF0;strokeColor=#10739E;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="s4gHost">
          <mxGeometry x="740" y="80" width="290" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4Adminer" value="&lt;b&gt;adminer&lt;/b&gt; — docker-compose.override.yml&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;chỉ dev, tự nạp khi chạy docker compose up không có -f&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="s4gHost">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="320" width="280" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4Db" value="&lt;b&gt;db&lt;/b&gt; — postgres:14&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;volume vivacon-db-data · init: schema.sql + 2 tệp function · không publish cổng (override mở 5433 cho dev)&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="s4gHost">
          <mxGeometry x="740" y="300" width="290" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4Managed" value="&lt;b&gt;PostgreSQL được quản lý (Supabase)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;DOCUMENTED ONLY: deployment.md. Code chỉ cho phép chọn qua SPRING_DATASOURCE_URL + DB_USERNAME&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7B1FA2;dashed=1;dashPattern=2 4;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
